{"id":"x8vejro4mphk4alkw2jxxnzbd","title":"CSS Working Group 决议：按钮使用 pointer 光标","originalTitle":"cursor:pointer on buttons","summary":"CSS 工作组在最近的会议上决定，按钮等交互元素应使用 pointer 光标，以指示可点击状态。这一决议总结了讨论中的意见，包括 text cursor 用于文本输入、grabbing hand 用于拖拽等。虽然默认浏览器样式可被用户自定义覆盖，但工作组认为这些元素应有明确的视觉反馈，以提升用户体验。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://blog.kizu.dev/cursors/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-15T09:15:40.744Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-16T16:59:33.172Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-16T16:59:33.172Z","category":"web-frontend","tags":["教程与观点"],"score":44,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"32b17e35-6cfb-4472-ad20-3a18ea69be52","title":"CSS工作组确立按钮等元素使用pointer光标标准"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"32b17e35-6cfb-4472-ad20-3a18ea69be52","title":"CSS工作组确立按钮等元素使用pointer光标标准"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fV81qNtHbh3o","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}